{"seq":3,"slug":"variables-factors","title":"因素与响应","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/experimental-design-doe/foundations/variables-factors","wordCount":1911,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"因素与响应\">因素与响应</h1><p>实验设计的所有讨论都建立在一套精确的词汇上。把这套词汇说含糊了，后面无论析因还是响应曲面都会跟着含糊。这一篇是本 hub 唯一系统定义这些术语的地方：因素、水平、处理、响应、效应及其各种类型。后面各章用到这些词时只引用、不再重复定义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>本文建立本 hub 的基础词汇表，各词条定义如下：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>因素</strong>（factor）：实验者主动改变、想研究其影响的输入变量。</li>\n<li><strong>水平</strong>（level）：某因素在实验中取的具体设定值。</li>\n<li><strong>处理</strong>（treatment）：所有因素各取一个水平构成的一个完整组合，即试验矩阵的一行。</li>\n<li><strong>响应</strong>（response）：测量的、想优化或理解的输出变量，记作 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li><strong>主效应</strong>（main effect）：某因素从低水平变到高水平时响应的平均变化。</li>\n<li><strong>交互效应</strong>（interaction effect）：一个因素的主效应随另一因素水平而变化的程度。</li>\n<li><strong>固定效应 / 随机效应</strong>：前者只针对实验中用到的特定水平，后者把水平视为从更大总体中随机抽取、推断其方差分量。</li>\n<li><strong>噪声因素</strong>（noise factor）：不想研究却会影响响应的变量；稳健设计追求的是让响应<strong>对噪声不敏感</strong>的可控因素配置。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这些词分成输入侧（因素、水平、处理）、输出侧（响应）和关系（效应）三组，后面析因、ANOVA、响应曲面全部在这套词汇上展开。</p>\n<h2 id=\"因素-水平-处理-实验的输入侧\">因素、水平、处理：实验的输入侧</h2><p><strong>因素</strong>（factor）是实验者主动改变、想研究其影响的输入变量。注塑里的料温是因素，咖啡萃取里的水温、研磨度、粉水比都是因素。<strong>水平</strong>（level）是某因素在实验中取的具体设定值；料温取 200℃ 和 230℃ 就是两个水平。<strong>处理</strong>（treatment）是所有因素各取一个水平的一个完整组合——在多因素实验里，一个处理就是试验矩阵的一行。</p>\n<p>因素按取值性质分两类，这个区分决定了能用什么设计与分析：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>因素类型</th>\n<th>取值</th>\n<th>例子</th>\n<th>能否估曲率</th>\n<th>典型设计归宿</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>定量/连续</td>\n<td>数值，可插值</td>\n<td>温度、压力、浓度</td>\n<td>能（需 ≥3 水平）</td>\n<td>响应曲面、DSD</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>定性/分类</td>\n<td>离散类别，不可插值</td>\n<td>催化剂种类、供应商</td>\n<td>不适用</td>\n<td>析因、区组</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这个区分很要紧：只有连续因素才谈得上「最优值在两水平之间」，因而才需要三水平以上的设计去捕捉曲率——这是 <a href=\"../analysis/response-surface\">响应曲面</a> 的前提。分类因素只能逐类比较，没有「中间值」可言。</p>\n<h2 id=\"响应-实验的输出侧\">响应：实验的输出侧</h2><p><strong>响应</strong>（response）是你测量的、想优化或理解的输出变量，记作 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span>。良率、产率、强度、点击率都是响应。好的响应应当可量化、可重复测量、且与真正关心的目标一致。实验设计里常被低估的一步是<strong>响应的选择</strong>：选错了响应（比如用「平均强度」却忽略「强度方差」），设计再精巧也优化错了方向。</p>\n<p>一个实验可以有多个响应。优化多响应时常用 desirability function 把若干响应合成一个总体满意度再优化，这属于 <a href=\"../analysis/response-surface\">响应曲面</a> 的范畴。本篇只确立：响应是因变量，因素是自变量，DOE 研究的就是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>因素</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>ε</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y = f(\\text{因素}) + \\varepsilon</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">因素</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span></span></span></span></span> 这个映射。</p>\n<h2 id=\"主效应与交互效应\">主效应与交互效应</h2><p><strong>效应</strong>（effect）量化因素如何改变响应，是 DOE 的核心估计对象。</p>\n<p><strong>主效应</strong>（main effect）指某因素从低水平变到高水平时，响应的平均变化。对两水平因素 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>主效应</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>y</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>y</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>−</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{主效应}(A) = \\bar{y}_{A+} - \\bar{y}_{A-}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">主效应</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7917em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5678em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7761em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5678em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>即 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 取高水平时所有响应的均值，减去 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 取低水平时的均值。注意「平均」二字——它是在其他因素的各种水平上平均出来的。</p>\n<p><strong>交互效应</strong>（interaction effect）指一个因素的主效应随另一因素水平而变化的程度。两因素 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span> 的交互定义为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>交互</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">[</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>y</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>+</mo></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>y</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>−</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>+</mo></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>y</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>−</mo></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>y</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>−</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>−</mo></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{交互}(AB) = \\frac{1}{2}\\big[(\\bar{y}_{A+|B+} - \\bar{y}_{A-|B+}) - (\\bar{y}_{A+|B-} - \\bar{y}_{A-|B-})\\big]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">交互</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0074em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">[</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5678em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.5198em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3552em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1052em;vertical-align:-0.3552em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5678em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.5198em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">+</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3552em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1052em;vertical-align:-0.3552em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5678em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.5198em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3552em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2052em;vertical-align:-0.3552em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5678em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.5198em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3552em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">]</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>括号里是「<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span> 高时 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 的效应」减「<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span> 低时 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 的效应」；若两者不等，就存在交互。交互效应的完整几何解释（平行线 vs 交叉线）与析因矩阵中的估计方法放在 <a href=\"../designs/factorial-designs\">析因设计</a> 主讲，这里只钉定义。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[实验] --&gt; B[因素&lt;br/&gt;主动改变的输入]&#10;  A --&gt; C[响应 y&lt;br/&gt;测量的输出]&#10;  B --&gt; D[水平&lt;br/&gt;因素的具体取值]&#10;  D --&gt; E[处理&lt;br/&gt;各因素一个水平的组合]&#10;  B --&gt; F{因素类型}&#10;  F --&gt;|连续| G[可估曲率&lt;br/&gt;-&gt;响应曲面]&#10;  F --&gt;|分类| H[逐类比较]&#10;  E --&gt; I[效应]&#10;  I --&gt; J[主效应&lt;br/&gt;因素单独的平均影响]&#10;  I --&gt; K[交互效应&lt;br/&gt;一因素效应随另一因素变]\">flowchart TD\n  A[实验] --&gt; B[因素&lt;br/&gt;主动改变的输入]\n  A --&gt; C[响应 y&lt;br/&gt;测量的输出]\n  B --&gt; D[水平&lt;br/&gt;因素的具体取值]\n  D --&gt; E[处理&lt;br/&gt;各因素一个水平的组合]\n  B --&gt; F{因素类型}\n  F --&gt;|连续| G[可估曲率&lt;br/&gt;-&gt;响应曲面]\n  F --&gt;|分类| H[逐类比较]\n  E --&gt; I[效应]\n  I --&gt; J[主效应&lt;br/&gt;因素单独的平均影响]\n  I --&gt; K[交互效应&lt;br/&gt;一因素效应随另一因素变]</pre><h2 id=\"固定效应与随机效应\">固定效应与随机效应</h2><p>同一个因素，按你关心「这几个特定水平」还是「水平所代表的总体」，分两种处理方式，对应两种统计模型。</p>\n<p><strong>固定效应</strong>（fixed effect）：你只关心实验中用到的那几个特定水平本身。比如比较「我们工厂现有的 3 台机器」，结论只针对这 3 台，不外推。模型把这些水平当常数参数估计。</p>\n<p><strong>随机效应</strong>（random effect）：实验中的水平是从一个更大总体里随机抽的，你关心的是总体的变异。比如从全国随机抽 5 个农场测某品种，你想推断的是「农场间变异有多大」而非这 5 个农场。模型把这些水平当随机变量，估计的是它们的方差分量。</p>\n<p>二者的区分直接改变 ANOVA 里 F 检验的分母该用哪个均方，是混合模型分析的关键，详见 <a href=\"../analysis/anova-effects\">方差分析与效应</a>。下表对照：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>固定效应</th>\n<th>随机效应</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>水平来源</td>\n<td>实验者特意选定</td>\n<td>从总体随机抽取</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>推断目标</td>\n<td>这几个水平的差异</td>\n<td>总体的方差分量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>外推范围</td>\n<td>仅限所用水平</td>\n<td>整个水平总体</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>典型例子</td>\n<td>3 种特定催化剂</td>\n<td>随机抽的 5 个批次</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"可控因素-噪声因素与稳健设计\">可控因素、噪声因素与稳健设计</h2><p>实验里还有一类不想研究、却会影响响应的变量：<strong>噪声因素</strong>（noise factor），如环境湿度、原料批次、用户使用习惯。与 <a href=\"principles-randomization\">随机化-重复-区组三原则</a> 呼应——已知的大噪声用区组隔离，未知的用随机化摊匀。</p>\n<p>但 Taguchi 学派提出更主动的视角：不只是消除噪声的影响，而是寻找一组<strong>可控因素</strong>配置，使响应对噪声<strong>不敏感</strong>。这就是稳健设计（robust design）：把可控因素和噪声因素放进同一个设计（内外表设计），优化的目标不是均值最优，而是「在噪声变动下仍稳定」。这一思想在 <a href=\"../practice/doe-applications\">应用与案例</a> 的制造场景里会具体展开。区分「想研究的因素 / 想消除的噪声」是设计前必做的分类。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>因素是主动改变的输入，水平是其取值，处理是各因素一个水平的组合，响应是测量的输出 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li>连续因素能估曲率（需 ≥3 水平），分类因素只能逐类比较——这决定设计选型。</li>\n<li>主效应是因素的平均影响，交互效应是「一因素效应随另一因素水平改变」的程度。</li>\n<li>固定效应只针对所用水平，随机效应推断水平总体的方差分量，二者改变 F 检验的构造。</li>\n<li>噪声因素用区组/随机化处理；稳健设计更进一步，追求对噪声不敏感的可控因素配置。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读-跨库链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨库链接</h2><ul>\n<li>交互效应的几何与析因估计：<a href=\"../designs/factorial-designs\">析因设计</a></li>\n<li>固定/随机效应如何改变 F 检验：<a href=\"../analysis/anova-effects\">方差分析与效应</a></li>\n<li>实验中变量与统计建模变量的对应：<a href=\"../../probability-statistics/statistical-inference/point-estimation\">点估计</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"因素与响应","id":"因素与响应"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"因素、水平、处理：实验的输入侧","id":"因素-水平-处理-实验的输入侧"},{"level":2,"text":"响应：实验的输出侧","id":"响应-实验的输出侧"},{"level":2,"text":"主效应与交互效应","id":"主效应与交互效应"},{"level":2,"text":"固定效应与随机效应","id":"固定效应与随机效应"},{"level":2,"text":"可控因素、噪声因素与稳健设计","id":"可控因素-噪声因素与稳健设计"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨库链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨库链接"}],"prev":{"title":"随机化-重复-区组三原则","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/experimental-design-doe/foundations/principles-randomization"},"next":{"title":"析因设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/experimental-design-doe/designs/factorial-designs"}}